{"data":[{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2112259793947885568"]},"author_id":"1615424029292400640","created_at":"2026-10-19T19:09:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112259840919900226"],"id":"2112259840919900226","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":28,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"The most mesmerizing Puja Pandal I ever visited !! Thank you Chetla Agrani Club for this 🙏🏻🙏🏻\n\nThank you my Bengali People for this !! 🙏🏻🙏🏻\n\nMay Maa Durga give me a chance to serve the people of West Bengal with full dedication and pride !! 🙏🏻🙏🏻\n\n#DurgaPuja2026 https://t.co/JUKSFG2K6s","url":"https://x.com/PKSpeaks07/status/2112259840919900226"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112249016528539648"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:26:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112249040251637894"],"id":"2112249040251637894","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":4104,"like_count":95,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":16},"text":"Chaltabagan at 11:52PM. No crowd or ad banners.\n\nHome to three iconic Durga Pujas (Lohapatty, Sarbojanin, Simla).\n\nClose to Hatibagan Nabin Pally, Kashi Bose, Nalin Sarkar, College Square, Santosh Mitra, Shyambazar &amp; Sealdah Station.\n\nPUJA VIBES ARE MISSING BECAUSE OF BJP! https://t.co/ZKD7yShUNJ","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2112249040251637894"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112239456220786688","3_2112239472813416448","3_2112239488315604992"]},"author_id":"1023150691030728704","created_at":"2026-10-19T17:48:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112239500701450465"],"id":"2112239500701450465","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":73,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#114 Visited Barisha Sarbojanin. This is neighbourhoof of Saborno Roy Choudhury. He was the the jamindar of entire modern day Kolkata and near by areas and sold 3 villages to the British. https://t.co/Y8h4nFhyT6","url":"https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2112239500701450465"},{"author_id":"4853557994","created_at":"2026-10-19T15:04:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112198269363499396"],"id":"2112198269363499396","in_reply_to_user_id":"4764615733","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2459,"like_count":37,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112176928857919900","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@abasu4ever Chorebagan incident happened day before yesterday. Yesterday I went out and saw good crowd. So stop this fake narrative","url":"https://x.com/tseringnio/status/2112198269363499396"},{"author_id":"4406245579","created_at":"2026-10-19T14:43:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112192903380623395"],"id":"2112192903380623395","in_reply_to_user_id":"715891580062683136","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":14,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112191710755160288","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@kaustav2001 @SudhanidhiB Arjunpur created a stampede-like situation on Saptami '25. Police promptly shut down the pandal on Saptami night, routed crowd through a much larger area after they opened on Ashtami night. We didn’t need 23k police \nSimilar situation happened on Friday at chorebagan. No shutdown","url":"https://x.com/the_echel0n_/status/2112192903380623395"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112099012690251776"]},"author_id":"22793955","created_at":"2026-10-19T08:30:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112099068810006898"],"id":"2112099068810006898","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":90,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"West Bengal Fire Services has issued show-cause notices to Chetla Agrani, Tridhara Sammilani and Ballygunge Cultural Association over alleged fire safety and crowd management lapses following the Chorbagan Durga Puja stampede that killed 19 people. Officials have also ordered the https://t.co/LJ7GrCGLcq","url":"https://x.com/indiacom/status/2112099068810006898"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112097407140016128","3_2112097407140057088","3_2112097407182000128","3_2112097407169437696"]},"author_id":"779250846580080640","created_at":"2026-10-19T08:23:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112097414836531229"],"id":"2112097414836531229","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"📰 NISHAAN makes headlines!\n\nThe inauguration of Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja’s 84th edition finds a place across the press. Grateful to the journalists sharing our story of faith, art and heritage. 🙏\n\n#ChaltabaganDurgaPuja #NishaanTheMark https://t.co/R3X70tWnZs","url":"https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112097414836531229"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112097205490528256","3_2112097205490495488","3_2112097205448495104","3_2112097205448499200"]},"author_id":"779250846580080640","created_at":"2026-10-19T08:23:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112097213392580776"],"id":"2112097213392580776","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"📰 A mark of faith. A story making headlines.\n\nThe inauguration of Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja’s 84th edition and “NISHAAN — The Mark” finds a place across the press. 🙏✨\n\nThank you to the publications\n#ChaltabaganDurgaPuja #NishaanTheMark #DurgaPuja20d https://t.co/bzz28fW05M","url":"https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112097213392580776"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2112079803138613248"]},"author_id":"3300305647","created_at":"2026-10-19T07:14:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112079830409769019"],"id":"2112079830409769019","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":740,"like_count":37,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":16},"text":"The CM himself was present at the inauguration