ets":[{"id":"2111870936899322362","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@SarkarSupriyo Fact : CM inaugurated Chorebagan.\n\n শমীক কাকা : এর সাথে সাথে দূর দূর পর্যন্ত আমাদের কোনো সম্পর্ক নেই. এটা বিজেপির সংস্কৃতি নয়.","url":"https://x.com/gags2519/status/2112013247931199511"},{"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-18T22:31:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111948413189357713"],"id":"2111948413189357713","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":5773,"like_count":188,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":28},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111947703219560730","type":"quoted"}],"text":"I went to New Alipore &amp; Behala tonight.\n\nFor the first time in my life, I didn't see lighting in Behala and crowd in New Alipore.\n\nOther than Tridhara, Santosh Mitra Square &amp; Chorebagan, no Durga Puja has been able to leave their mark.\n\nBJP have well &amp; truly ruined Durga Puja. https://t.co/L3DsUjh4uq","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2111948413189357713"},{"author_id":"334586002","created_at":"2026-10-18T22:24:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111946669936030186"],"id":"2111946669936030186","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":59,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Requesting @Bihar_se_hai, @IndexBihar ,@BiharCMQRT ,@WithLoveBihar ,@IPRDBihar &amp; other independent or associated handles to showcase the discipline &amp; crowd management in pandals to counter narrative run by Bengalis to defame Biharis &amp; Bihar in Chorebagan incident.\nAct in Unison !","url":"https://x.com/ujjwalschauhan/status/2111946669936030186"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111887009405075456","3_2111887024684933120","3_2111887044637270016","3_2111887070134505472"]},"author_id":"1023150691030728704","created_at":"2026-10-18T18:28:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111887088958513154"],"id":"2111887088958513154","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":625,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"#88 Visited Ekdalia. Beautiful pandal and pratima as always. Look at the posture of pratima. That is what sets it apart from the rest. Face, eyes aren't the only things. Look at how mother and rest are sitting. Absolutely stunning. Greatest of South Kolkata for a reason. https://t.co/cfJE7N9sHP","url":"https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111887088958513154"},{"author_id":"1423538697736056835","created_at":"2026-10-18T17:46:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111876621330436329"],"id":"2111876621330436329","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":1369,"like_count":126,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":28},"text":"Chorebagan Sarbojanin was awarded the “Sherar shera” (Best of the best) award yesterday evening before the tragic incident. \nAs per my understanding, “sherar shera” should tick every single box of credibility including disaster preparedness and evacuation contingency plan. \nToday","url":"https://x.com/TrikaTriggered/status/2111876621330436329"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2111873528199028736"]},"author_id":"1365324827830022149","created_at":"2026-10-18T17:34:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111873586600538361"],"id":"2111873586600538361","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":3422,"like_count":63,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":18},"text":"Suvendu Adhikari before &amp; after Chorebagan Durga Puja tragedy in Kolkata, killing 20. He inaugurated the pandal where his party colleagues head the organizing committee. My reading of his appearance - anxious inside, but desperately weaving a masterful tale to divert the blame. https://t.co/73m0Z5znzg","url":"https://x.com/SeemaSengupta5/status/2111873586600538361"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-10-18T16:59:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111864763000975776"],"id":"2111864763000975776","in_reply_to_user_id":"2336848224","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3